---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../lib/site';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Copyright & rights holders"
  lead="TCG Vault is an unofficial fan project. The games, cards and artwork shown here belong to their owners."
  group="legal"
  updated="5 October 2026"
>
  <h2>Riftbound</h2>
  <p>
    TCG Vault was created under Riot Games' "Legal Jibber Jabber" policy using assets owned by Riot Games. Riot Games does
    not endorse or sponsor this project.
  </p>
  <p>Riftbound, its card names, text, artwork, icons and logos are trademarks and copyrights of Riot Games, Inc.</p>


  <h2>What TCG Vault uses them for</h2>
  <p>
    Card images and details are shown so players can identify cards, track their collections, build decks and trade with each
    other. TCG Vault is free to use and does not sell card images or game content.
  </p>

  <h2>Photos and content from users</h2>
  <p>
    Photos and text that users upload with their listings, reviews and messages belong to the people who posted them. If you
    believe something on the site uses your work without permission, tell us.
  </p>

  <h2>Rights holders: asking for removal</h2>
  <p>
    If you own the rights to something shown here and want it changed or taken down, email
    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>what the content is and where it appears (a link is best);</li>
    <li>who you are and how you hold the rights;</li>
    <li>what you would like us to do.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We respond as quickly as we can, and remove content that shouldn't be here.</p>
</DocLayout>
